{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.coverage.module_source",
              "name": "coverage.module_source",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#module-source-coverage",
                "markdown": "**Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.coverage.module_source\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#module-source-coverage)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#module-source-coverage",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "coverage"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ctf.origin.provider",
              "name": "origin.provider",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A provider outside the approved list is in use"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A provider outside the approved list is in use"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A provider outside the approved list is in use. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#provider-and-module-origin",
                "markdown": "**A provider outside the approved list is in use.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.origin.provider\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#provider-and-module-origin)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#provider-and-module-origin",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "origin"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.0"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.coverage.module_source",
          "level": "error",
